 "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "morphism of topoi", "target_term": "拓扑斯的态射"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "嵌入"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一个景（site），它由赋予<MATH_0002>混沌拓扑（topology）得到（预层（presheaves）都是层（sheaves））。存在一个拓扑斯的态射（morphism of topoi）<MATH_0003>，其中<MATH_0004>是嵌入（inclusion），从层（sheaves）到预层（presheaves），而<MATH_0005>是层化。由引理<REF_0001>，只需对<MATH_0006>证明该结果，即在<MATH_0007>具有混沌拓扑（topology）的情形下证明。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n若<MATH_0008>具有混沌拓扑（topology），则<MATH_0009>等于<MATH_0010>，因为\n<MATHSEG_0001>上的截面<MATHSEG_0002>上的截面<MATHSEG_0003>\n交换（commutes）。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:2deff9534ea8e3d5fc293cafe9b4964984a445ef513dfe069142d92c8642c0be", "unit_id": "tag:08SW:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "此处由同一底层范畴赋予混沌拓扑得到，暂用“景”。", "source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"context": "此处均指使预层成为层的混沌拓扑，暂用“拓扑”。", "source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"context": "此处与层比较并作为嵌入的目标，暂用“预层”。", "source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"context": "此处指混沌拓扑下的层及嵌入的来源，暂用“层”。", "source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "此处联系原拓扑与混沌拓扑所对应的拓扑斯，暂用此译名。", "source_term": "morphism of topoi", "target_term": "拓扑斯的态射"}, {"context": "此处将层视为预层，暂译为“嵌入”。", "source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "嵌入"}, {"context": "此处说明用于比较两对象的图中复合相等，暂用“交换”。", "source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}]}
